--- orig/A501-main/DEPLOY_GUIDE.md	1970-01-01 00:00:00.000000000 +0000
+++ a501src/A501-main/DEPLOY_GUIDE.md	2026-11-04 08:21:59.021400680 +0000
@@ -0,0 +1,113 @@
+# A501 / Huka Tube — VPS deploy, hidden origin, Telegram se updates
+
+## Kya badla (short)
+
+| Cheez | Pehle | Ab |
+|---|---|---|
+| App ka server address | Railway URL source mein hardcoded | **Tumhara domain** (GitHub secret `BACKEND_URL` se, source mein nahi) |
+| Server kahan hai | Railway/VPS IP | **Cloudflare Tunnel** — VPS par koi port khula nahi, IP kahin nahi dikhta |
+| VPS badalna | app update ya URL change | **Sirf tunnel naye VPS par chalao** — app ko kuch pata nahi chalta |
+| Domain badalna | app dead | Bot se `/endpoints add` — app khud naya domain seekh leta hai, purana mare to switch kar leta hai |
+| App update | GitHub se APK manually | **Telegram bot se**: `/setapk` (naya APK), `/setbundle` (naya UI/features, bina reinstall) |
+| Notification | — | App ke andar popup + 🔔 bell mein card |
+
+## 1. Ek baar ka setup
+
+### 1.1 Domain + Cloudflare
+1. Domain lo (WHOIS privacy ON), Cloudflare (free) mein add karo, nameservers badlo.
+2. Cloudflare → **Zero Trust → Networks → Tunnels → Create tunnel → Cloudflared**. Naam: `a501`.
+3. **Token copy karo** (lamba `eyJ...` text) — yehi VPS ki `.env` mein jayega.
+4. Tunnel ke **Public hostname** mein add karo: `api.yourdomain.com` → Service type **HTTP** → URL `app:8000`.
+
+### 1.2 GitHub (repo **PRIVATE** rakho)
+Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions → New secret:
+
+| Secret | Value |
+|---|---|
+| `BACKEND_URL` | `https://api.yourdomain.com` |
+| `BACKEND_FALLBACKS` | (optional) `https://backup.example.com` |
+| `KEYSTORE_B64`, `KEYSTORE_PASSWORD`, `KEY_ALIAS`, `KEY_PASSWORD` | neeche |
+
+**Signing key (bahut zaroori)** — Android sirf usi key se signed APK ko update ki tarah install karta hai. Ek baar banao aur **backup rakho** (kho gayi to sab users ko reinstall karna padega):
+```bash
+keytool -genkeypair -v -keystore release.jks -alias huka -keyalg RSA -keysize 2048 -validity 10000
+base64 -w0 release.jks      # is output ko KEYSTORE_B64 secret mein daalo
+```
+
+## 2. VPS par deploy (Ubuntu/Debian)
+
+```bash
+# apne computer se zip upload karo, phir VPS par:
+unzip A501-update.zip -d /opt && cd /opt/A501-main
+sudo bash deploy/vps-setup.sh            # docker + firewall (sirf SSH khula)
+
+cd backend
+cp sample_config.env config.env && nano config.env   # API_ID, API_HASH, BOT_TOKEN, DATABASE, OWNER_ID, PHONE_BOT_TOKENS ... (wahi purani values)
+cp .env.example .env && nano .env                    # TUNNEL_TOKEN=eyJ...
+```
+
+⚠️ **Pehle purana Railway service band karo** (stop/pause). Same bot token / userbot session do jagah ek saath chalane se Telegram session kharab ho sakta hai aur messages double process hote hain.
+
+```bash
+docker compose up -d --build
+docker compose logs -f app        # "Started Successfully" dikhe
+```
+
+Phir browser mein `https://api.yourdomain.com/login` → admin login → **Settings → Base URL** = `https://api.yourdomain.com` → Save.
+(Base URL database mein save hota hai, config.env se sirf pehli baar leta hai — isliye yahin badalna zaroori hai, nahi to stream links purane address ke aayenge.)
+
+Database (MongoDB) wahi rahega, to users/tokens/library sab jaise the waise.
+
+## 3. App build
+
+1. Is zip ki files apne GitHub repo mein replace karo, push karo.
+2. **Actions → Build APK** chalega → artifacts: `huka-apk` (APK) aur `huka-ui-bundle` (index.html). Run ke summary mein ready-made bot commands bhi likhe aate hain.
+3. **Pehli baar** naya APK manually install karo (purana app **uninstall** karna padega — purani APK alag key se signed thi). Uske baad sab update bot se.
+
+## 4. Telegram se update bhejna (sirf OWNER_ID wale ko chalte hain)
+
+**Naya UI / features (reinstall nahi, sabse aasaan):**
+1. Actions artifact `huka-ui-bundle` se `index.html` bot ko bhejo.
+2. Us file par reply karke:
+```
+/setbundle version=93
+✨ Naya theme
+🐞 Fixes
+```
+App background mein download karta hai → 🔔 aur popup: **"Naye features ready — Restart"**. (`force` likho to bina puche apply ho jaata hai.) Naya UI agar 2 baar boot nahi hua to app khud purane UI par wapas aa jaata hai.
+
+`min=` : sabse purana APK code jis par yeh UI chalta hai. Default = abhi live APK ka code. Agar UI ke saath native (Kotlin) change bhi hai to pehle `/setapk`, phir `/setbundle`.
+
+**Naya APK (native change):**
+```
+/setapk code=93 name=1.93        (file ka naam HukaTube_1.93_93.apk ho to code/name apne aap mil jaate hain)
+Naya player controls
+```
+Reply karo APK file par. Users ko popup aata hai → **Update now** → download → Android installer. `force` likho to popup band nahi hota.
+
+Baaki: `/updateinfo` (kya live hai), `/clearupdate apk|bundle` (wapas lena), `/endpoints` (mirror domains).
+
+## 5. VPS badalna (app ko kuch pata nahi chalta)
+
+Naye VPS par: `vps-setup.sh` → repo/`backend` folder copy (`config.env`, `.env`, aur `data/` — `rsync -a olduser@oldvps:/opt/A501-main/backend/ /opt/A501-main/backend/`).
+1. Purane VPS par: `docker compose stop app` (bot sirf ek jagah chalna chahiye)
+2. Naye VPS par: `docker compose up -d --build`
+3. Cloudflare Tunnel same token se naye VPS par connect ho jaata hai → domain wahi, app wahi. ~1 minute ka downtime.
+4. Purane VPS par `docker compose down`. 
+
+`data/` copy na karo to bhi chalega: APK/bundle Telegram se dobara utar jaate hain (nahi to `/setapk` dobara bhejo).
+
+## 6. Railway ya kahin aur chalana
+Wahi Dockerfile chalta hai. Domain Cloudflare par rakho aur:
+- jis host par Docker Compose chale (VPS, Oracle, etc.) wahan upar wala compose = best (IP bilkul nahi dikhta);
+- Railway par: custom domain `api.yourdomain.com` Cloudflare DNS mein **orange-cloud (proxied)** CNAME se Railway ko point karo. App/users ko sirf Cloudflare dikhta hai, Railway ka naam nahi.
+Server badalne ka matlab hamesha: *sirf domain/tunnel ka target badlo*.
+
+## 7. Privacy — sach kitna chhupta hai
+- ✅ App/users/network inspection mein sirf `api.yourdomain.com` (Cloudflare IPs) dikhta hai; VPS IP, Railway, hosting provider nahi.
+- ✅ Source mein koi server address nahi; `/docs`, `/openapi.json`, `Server:` header band; `HIDE_PUBLIC_PAGES=true` se `/status`, `/stremio` bhi 404.
+- ⚠️ APK decompile karne par domain mil jaata hai (koi bhi app ise chhupa nahi sakta). Isliye domain ke peeche sirf Cloudflare rakho, WHOIS privacy ON, domain pe personal website/email mat jodo.
+- ⚠️ Purani APK (jisme Railway URL bundled hai) ab bhi Railway par hi jaayegi — unhe naya APK manually install karwana padega; tab tak Railway chalu rakhna padega agar unhe chalana hai.
+- ⚠️ Purani git history mein Railway URL ho sakta hai — repo private rakho.
+- ⚠️ Cloudflare ko origin pata hota hai (wahi tunnel chalata hai). Cloudflare free plan ki shartein bade video-proxy traffic ko restrict karti hain; is app mein video phone ke andar TDLib se seedha Telegram se aata hai (backend sirf chhota `/resolve` JSON deta hai), isliye abhi theek hai — sirf split/Drive wale fallback `/dl` proxy se jaate hain.
+- ⚠️ OTA UI bundle ka bharosa tumhare backend par hai (HTTPS + checksum). Backend/bot token surakshit rakho — OWNER_ID ke alawa koi `/setbundle` nahi chala sakta.
